   "text": "Abbey College Cambridge - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nAbbey College Cambridge\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nAbbey is a top-performing boarding college located in the centre of Cambridge. Since it's foundation in 1994, Abbey Cambridge has helped thousands of students to achieve outstanding academic results and join some of the world’s best universities. Cambridge is recognized as one of the best places in the UK for international students to live, learn and thrive. In 2020 a remarkable 83% of A level grades were awarded an A* or A, and students regularly enter elite UK and Global Universities.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 07:10\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 07:10\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nHigh School\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £41,592.15\nMin: £41,592.15\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n90%\n360 of 400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1994\nCampus(es)\nCambridge\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nPakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/09/2025\nContract End Date\n31/07/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nOn campus accommodation is available for all international students.\nScholarship Offered\nPartial merit scholarships are available for select international students. \nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ReBed1o5I1c\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
